# my_lists = [[10, 20, 30], [], [5, 5, 90]]
# hist_result = create_hist_from_sublists(my_lists, bins=8, seed=123)
# If histofill plotting API is available the function will call it and typically display/return the plot object;
# otherwise hist_result will be a dict with counts/bin_edges/data.
