- generate_date_matrix(2, 3, "2026-03-01", "2026-03-10") -> 2×3 matrix of dates from 2026-03-01 onward.

If you want the matrix elements as ISO strings instead of date objects, do:
- [[d.isoformat() for d in row] for row in generate_date_matrix(...)].

